a good spot to watch a game. I ordered breakfast, lunch, and a dinner meal throughout my stay. The first order I received was to the room for breakfast. The service was very quick. It took at most 20 minutes for the f..."},{"business_id":"ZY2feSm2sc5nTXYHnKpMGQ","review_id":"LsYUVumhEbdHRL3_70Js8g","date":"2019-11-26T09:35:33","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.934428334236145,"text_excerpt":"We stopped in here for a bite to eat after spending the afternoon out and about in NOLA. We were staying at the hotel and just wanted something to hold us through the night. The menu had a huge selection of sushi (which is evidently their \"thing), but had many other options as well. Sushi was not our plan for the night, so we opted to split the crispy Brussel sprouts and a veggie pizza. The Brussel sprouts were crisp, sweet and charred just the right amount. The pizza was good, not amazing - but would get it again. We chose cauliflower, garlic and green pepper for our topping (those were our options in addition to green olives). Could have used more topping choices, more sauce and definit..."},{"business_id":"ZY2feSm2sc5nTXYHnKpMGQ","review_id":"sOYdK8A5_zmTR0ManIxQDQ","date":"2018-12-28T01:58:40","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9225107431411743,"text_excerpt":"So I stopped by to see what they have to offer. It's a sports bar, located within the Hyatt Regency. I sat at the bar and was greeted by a nice bartender. I used my Yelp coupon to try their chips, which were really good! Comes in 3 flavors: Sour Cream, BBQ, & Sour Cream n Cheddar, I think. The last one was my least fav. I ordered a Peach Sangria w/red wine & charbroiled oysters. Both were delicious. I enjoyed my visit."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"ZY2feSm2sc5nTXYHnKpMGQ","photo_id":"FarxSEeGUEoBzsEATje_zg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/FarxSEeGUEoBzsEATje_zg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9061114192008972},{"business_id":"ZY2feSm2sc5nTXYHnKpMGQ","photo_id":"x-kiu6tHfhKVtylQ0gqF-A","label":"inside","i